  <title>Mugak</title>

  <p>Convey is still in early development. Convey supports IMAP and has
  been tested with Gmail, Yahoo, and the free Dovecot mail server.
  Experimental support for Outlook.com is provided.  Convey may not yet
  work well with some IMAP servers.  At this time Convey is still
  missing numerous features including offline mode.</p>

  <p>To learn more about the features we're working on and the future
  of Convey, please visit Convey's <link href="https://wiki.gnome.org/Apps/Geary">wiki page</link>.</p>

</page>
